# Trivy ignore list. Every entry needs a justification and an expiry (exp:) so it is re-evaluated.

# http-cache-semantics <=4.2.0 (no patched release): cross-user disclosure via max-stale in shared caches.
# Not affected: only used at build time (astro remote-image cache for the static site, and got ->
# cacheable-request in electron-builder for Electron downloads). No shared multi-user HTTP cache.
CVE-2026-93748 exp:2027-01-03

# github.com/docker/docker v28.5.2+incompatible: no fixed release on this module path (the fixes ship
# only under github.com/moby/moby/v2). Required by packages/loxel/scripts/docker-lsp-module through
# buildx and compose-go. Not affected: both are Docker Engine flaws (image extraction, container file
# handling), and docker-language-server links only pkg/namesgenerator from this module, on every
# platform (`go list -deps`), which imports nothing but math/rand and strconv.
CVE-2026-41567 exp:2026-12-17
CVE-2026-42306 exp:2026-12-17
